  "description": "Convention-based dependency registration for Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection. Mark an interface with IAutoInjection and AddAutoInjection registers it, with transient/scoped/singleton markers and an [Injection] attribute for explicit pairs. Includes an ambient service locator for types the container cannot construct.",
  "id": "Muslim.Inject",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-10T07:33:29.467Z",
