  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds AddAutoInjection(assemblies) so hosts no longer hand-write the reflection scan, plus ITransientInjection/ISingletonInjection markers, a Lifetime on [Injection], InjectRequired, TryInject and RunInScopeAsync. Inject() now reports a missing provider instead of silently returning null. Fixes a cross-request scope leak present through 2.0.0 — see CHANGELOG.md.",
